<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Perpetual 95/96 net rises 29.4 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Perpetual 95/96 net rises 29.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 21.03 vs  15.01</p>
<p>    Net profit			 14.56 vs  11.25</p>
<p>    Sales				86.46 vs 82.15</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    22 vs 21</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    36 vs 34</p>
<p>NOTE: Perpetual Trustees Australia Ltd is Australia's largest trustee company.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
